<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-VILNIAUS BANK TOPS LIST OF BROKERS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-VILNIAUS BANK TOPS LIST OF BROKERS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The brokerage arm of Vilniaus</p>
<p>Bank topped Lithuania's list of brokerages for the first four</p>
<p>months of 1997, despite trailing Vilfima and Suprema in trade</p>
<p>of shares, the bourse said on Monday. </p>
<p>Vilniaus Bank's dominant positition was due to its 47.77</p>
<p>percent share of the T-bill market.</p>
<p>A list of Lithuania's top brokerages for the first months</p>
<p>of 1997 follows, with turnover figures (in millions of litas)</p>
<p>for trade in shares, T-bills, total turnover and total market</p>
<p>share:</p>
<p>COMPANY:		SHARES    T-BILLS   TOTAL   MARKET SHARE</p>
<p>Vilniaus Bank	  91.4     163.0     254.4   30.17%</p>
<p>Vilfima		 109.7	 7.3     117.0   13.87%</p>
<p>Suprema		  95.6	 2.4	98.0   11.62%</p>
<p>Savings Bank	    8.2	48.9	57.0    6.76%</p>
<p>Agricultural Bank     1.1	30.2	31.4    3.72%</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom, +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
